{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Strategic Battle for Grid Domination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the vibrant world of Spectrum Siege, a turn-based strategy game where every move reshapes the battlefield.\u00a0 Starting from an 11x11 grid, three colors clash in a tactical struggle to conquer the most territory. Easy to learn, but deeply strategic, Spectrum Siege offers endless possibilities for clever moves and bold strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump and Conquer:</strong> Leap over adjacent opponent cells to claim them and expand your control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Grid:</strong> Watch the board transform as every jump changes the color landscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outthink Your Opponent:</strong> Plan your moves carefully to capture the most cells while blocking your rivals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer Modes:</strong> Test your skills against NPC opponents or challenge friends in local.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Yet Deep Mechanics:</strong> Perfect for casual players and hardcore strategists alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Visuals:</strong> A sleek, colorful design that brings the game board to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> With different starting setups and player strategies, no two games are ever the same.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Will Control the Grid?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dominate the board with cunning tactics, or will your opponents outmaneuver you? Whether you\u2019re a fan of strategy games, puzzles, or intense competition, Spectrum Siege is your next addiction. Jump in and show your true colors!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Total Annihilation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434620/14d12c934de9b0a4ee385ffa6e58a0bdebba95ca.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Grid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434620/1f7c106ec3f86b6824e8fc7d8b2722c0e89887ea.jpg"},{"name":"Aggression Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434620/59ed3e7315926523c67d53cd7ea354691e85b1e7.jpg"},{"name":"Unexpected Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434620/23708eb65eda22869a427bd28e3e078671489002.jpg"},{"name":"Against the Clock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434620/1528db71924f1b2b178c2f3320209f07a4b0a23d.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434620/6909cf24cc8ccf63340a2b33296f793e8b0a3e74.jpg"},{"name":"Too Hot to Handle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434620/8d6b1d3d3c659034d21f8d685682a487efee2102.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434620?t=1743362154","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434620?t=1743362154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434620/977bf78222a3e052a8c3d1e405bd87bbd86c55cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743362154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434620/977bf78222a3e052a8c3d1e405bd87bbd86c55cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743362154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","i